OL,3,ADenmark to ban mink farming in
OL,4,Agovernment U-turn
OL,5,
OL,6,FMink farming will end in Denmark by
OL,7,FAugust 2029 after the government
OL,8,Fdecided to drop plans to pursue an
OL,9,Fexemption to an EU-wide ban on the
OL,10,Fpractice.
OL,12,FDenmark was once the largest producer
OL,13,Fof mink fur in the world, but the
OL,14,Findustry has declined due to global
OL,15,Fbans on fur farming, a decline in the
OL,16,Ffur trade and an earlier outbreak of a
OL,17,FCovid strain in the nation's mink
OL,18,Fpopulation.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
