OL,3,ADenmark to ban mink farming in
OL,4,Agovernment U-turn
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ban is due to come into effect on 7
OL,7,FAugust next year, and is followed by a
OL,8,Ftwo-year transition period to phase out
OL,9,Fthe practice.
OL,11,FDanish Nature Minister Christian
OL,12,FRabjerg Madsen said the government had
OL,13,Fchosen animal welfare.
